  "body": "## What changed\n\nExterior contour rings keep every requested depth when the complete cutter-center ring clears the model's XY convex hull.\nThe sign plate reaches Z 0 and keeps its four tabs.\nPicked contours refuse generation when a required deeper section cannot be read.\nThe error names the section failure and the skipped levels.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe depth ladder read interior sections even for a cutter outside the complete model footprint.\nA failed section could become a false floor.\nThe picked-ring check accepted this partial path after an earlier level succeeded.\n\n## Tests\n\nBoth pins fail when the original `upstream/main` depth code is restored.\nThe plate pin fails in release after 151.28 seconds.\nIt reports floor Z 7.061 and misses Z 6.\nThe unread-section pin fails in debug because it returns a partial path.\nBoth pins pass in debug after the fix is restored, in 0.31 seconds.\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passes all 146 selected steps.\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion --all-targets -- -D warnings` passes.\n\n- `outside_sign_plate_reaches_bottom_with_four_tabs` checks every requested depth and four bottom cut runs.\n- `picked_ring_refuses_unread_deeper_plane_after_clear_levels` checks refusal after earlier levels succeed.\n\nThe mesh fixture contains only the `sign` entity's saved triangles from the [reported q04 project](https://github.com/mkinney/Camcraft/blob/qa-artifacts/qa/round2-20261122/q04-vcarve-sign/q04-vcarve-sign-posted-5ops.camproj).\nThe test does not import STEP or load the saved toolpath.\n\n## Heavy lanes\n\n`cargo xtask gate heavy --base upstream/main` ran on head e30244c56c3c3d4b83ba918259daffe3b3cffdc4.\nThe base was `upstream/main` at ef157211438104997fc9e51f7e3affc4db303545.\nThe diff reaches the `motion heavy` and `app heavy` lanes (every target).\nResult: green. 244 steps ran, 0 failed, 0 known-fail skips. Wall time was 51.2 min.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\nNo `.nc` or `.cl` files change.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe reported project was not run through the GUI or MCP.\nThe complete post flow for this project was not run.\nThe regression calls the motion generator on the saved model mesh.\nThe 0.02 mm allowance, `tab_count: 0`, and bottom-chain variants were not run separately.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone.\n\nEffort: high\n\nChangelog: Keep proven-clear outside contours at every requested depth and refuse unreadable partial picked contours.\n\nFixes #3443\n\n",
